<section class="sect" id="how" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
    <h2 id="howTitle">See it before you buy it</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <article>
        <h3>Request a demo game</h3>
        <p>Tell us who you are and where your members do business. It takes two minutes.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>We agree on a time</h3>
        <p>A manager contacts you within one business day and sets up the demo at a time that suits you.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Play the demo</h3>
        <p>60 minutes online for your board, your staff or your bank team. Free.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Choose a package</h3>
        <p>Pilot, Signature Event or Annual Program — paid by your chamber or by a sponsor.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Games at your chamber</h3>
        <p>Members play in your room. Our host joins on the big screen, or your sponsor's certified host runs the game in person.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Report and next game</h3>
        <p>After every game you get a short report for your board and sponsor, and the next month's invitation texts.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
